  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">B4D Innovations for Peace - Emprender Paz</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">B4D Innovations for Peace - Emprender Paz</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Insats som syftar till att bidra till fredsbyggande i Colombia genom  att engagera och mobilisera privata sektorn f&#xf6;r inclusive sustainable  business. Avtalspart: GIZ. Tre komponenter: 1) skapa och genomf&#xf6;ra   en ny challenge fund Innovations for Peace, 2) skala upp existerande  Emprender Paz-pris, 3) st&#xe4;rka lokala partners kapacitet och &#xe4;garskap  med sikte p&#xe5; lokalt &#xf6;vertagande 2015.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Intervention aiming to contribute to peace-building in Colombia       through engagement and mobilization of the private sector for         inclusive sustainable business. Agreement partner:GIZ. 3 components:  1) create and implement a new challenge fund Innovations for Peace,   2) scale up existing Emprender Paz award, 3) strengthen local         partners&apos; capacity and ownership with a view to local takeover 2015.</narrative>
  </description>
